### =========================
### BACKEND B - TEST GUIDE
### =========================
### Cach dung:
### 1. Chay app: mvn spring-boot:run
### 2. Bam "Send Request" o request Login teacher
### 3. Copy accessToken tra ve va dan vao @teacherToken ben duoi
### 4. Bam "Send Request" o request Login student
### 5. Copy accessToken tra ve va dan vao @studentToken ben duoi
### 6. Test tu tren xuong duoi.
###
### Du lieu mau dang co:
### teacher / teacher123
### student / student123
### classId = 1
### student da duoc enroll vao classId = 1

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@teacherToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ0ZWFjaGVyIiwicm9sZSI6IlRFQUNIRVIiLCJpYXQiOjE3ODUzOTQ0NDksImV4cCI6MTc4NTQ4MDg0OX0.qCef_DCaLtXeBlmsUrBPR7JkG6HdByxir1glm6Th1BM
@studentToken = paste_student_token_here
@classId = 1
@assignmentId = 4
@submissionId = 4
@studentId = 3

### B1. Login teacher
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "teacher",
  "password": "teacher123"
}

### B2. Login student
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "student",
  "password": "student123"
}

### B3. Teacher tao bai tap
### Sau khi tao thanh cong, copy id tra ve va gan vao @assignmentId phia tren.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

{
  "classId": {{classId}},
  "title": "Test backend B",
  "description": "Bai tap test API phan B",
  "dueDate": "2026-08-02T23:59:00",
  "maxScore": 10,
  "weight": 1
}

### B4. Xem danh sach bai tap cua lop
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/class/{{classId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### B5. Xem chi tiet bai tap va danh sach nop bai
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/{{assignmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### B6. Student xem bai tap cua lop
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/class/{{classId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### B7. Student nop bai bang file
### Luu y: sua duong dan file neu may ban khong co file nay.
### Sau khi nop thanh cong, copy id tra ve va gan vao @submissionId phia tren.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/assignments/{{assignmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----EduSystemBoundary

------EduSystemBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test-submission.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Noi dung bai nop test phan B
------EduSystemBoundary--

### B8. Student xem cac bai da nop cua minh
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/me
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### B9. Teacher xem danh sach bai nop theo bai tap
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/assignments/{{assignmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### B10. Teacher xem sinh vien nao da/chua nop
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/assignments/{{assignmentId}}/students
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### B11. Teacher cham diem bai nop
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/grades/submissions/{{submissionId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

{
  "score": 8.5,
  "feedback": "Lam bai tot"
}

### B12. Xem diem cua bai nop
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/grades/submissions/{{submissionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### B13. Student xem diem cua minh trong lop
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/grades/students/{{studentId}}/classes/{{classId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### B14. Teacher xem thong ke lop
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/classes/{{classId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### B15. Teacher xem thong ke sinh vien
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/students/{{studentId}}/classes/{{classId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### B16. Dashboard tong quan
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
